try><entry><title>Prague honors Roma resistance fighters against Hitler</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c06d832c28084d275127646a37badb59bd9b4bdbfd4c882a5181edc844d50867</id><updated>2026-10-26T05:01:21Z</updated><published>2026-10-25T09:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/prague-honors-roma-resistance-fighters-against-hitler/a-79725015--c9d68b8992df.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/prague-honors-roma-resistance-fighters-against-hitler/a-79725015?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">More than 1,400 Roma fought against the German Nazi occupation in Czechoslovakia. A new exhibition in Prague showcases the stories of partisans and soldiers whose fates barely received any attention for decades.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Saudi Arabia looks to US for an AI edge as Yemen's Houthis up pressure</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:da57a86ac6a531ae81ef7c720715f03c1c70c113614da078f845917d83b046a7</id><updated>2026-10-26T05:00:18Z</updated><published>2026-10-25T09:13:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/saudi-arabia-looks-to-us-for-an-ai-edge-as-yemen-s-houthis-up-pressure/a-79735138--9b8ebc9e4129.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/saudi-arabia-looks-to-us-for-an-ai-edge-as-yemen-s-houthis-up-pressure/a-79735138?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US is helping Saudi Arabia fight the Houthi group in Yemen with AI-assisted targeting. But AI is not a magic bullet, experts say, and there are technological, political and human rights issues to consider.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>In Bulgaria, record low voter turnout triggers a November 1 presidential run-off in a poll colored by divisions over Ukraine war</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ca2f60ff890ac461fd8ead05593a9437fced3c13450fcaf981fa4f4f6cf41a85</id><updated>2026-10-26T05:00:18Z</updated><published>2026-10-25T07:19:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/in-bulgaria-record-low-voter-turnout-triggers-a-november-1-presidential-run-off-in-a-poll-colored-by/a-79753496--78ae87f6d8b4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/in-bulgaria-record-low-voter-turnout-triggers-a-november-1-presidential-run-off-in-a-poll-colored-by-divisions-over-ukraine-war/a-79753496?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Low voter turnout has triggered a run-off for the Bulgarian presidency. The vote was colored by strong divisions over Russia's war in Ukraine, and Sofia's relations with the Kremlin.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Trump announces Audi will build $4 billion factory in US</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2c397d83e328f357d543b7f458b5a4ae9265295a48221147368c466042760623</id><updated>2026-10-26T05:00:18Z</updated><published>2026-10-25T04:44:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-announces-audi-will-build-4-billion-factory-in-us/a-79753479--4f2bdda08cd3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-announces-audi-will-build-4-billion-factory-in-us/a-79753479?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After Donald Trump made the announcement at an election rally in Georgia, the German carmaker confirmed plans for a factory in the US state, but noted car production would only start early next decade.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>New York Archdiocese to pay $800 million to sex abuse survivors</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1b8c342f9df8577109cfd345bb4c685283cb3ec0620bd8cc55caed93e140dae1</id><updated>2026-10-26T05:00:18Z</updated><published>2026-10-25T02:07:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/new-york-archdiocese-to-pay-800-million-to-sex-abuse-survivors/a-79753347--80193959f91a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ne