-79734069--662f4c5402cf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/will-guinea-bissau-remain-trapped-in-political-chaos/a-79734069?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Elections scheduled for December 6 in Guinea-Bissau have been postponed indefinitely. No new date has been set, leaving the country's return to civilian rule uncertain.</summary><category term="NRS-Import" /></entry></feed>
